<section id="Sx10" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section">D. More Experimental Results</h2>

<div id="Sx10.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Sx10.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Here we present more experimental data, covering additional dimensions, a broader range of metrics, and more test datasets.</p>
</div>
<section id="Sx10.SSx1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection">Scaling Embedding Size</h3>

<figure id="Sx10.T8" class="ltx_table">
<table id="Sx10.T8.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="Sx10.T8.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="Sx10.T8.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt"><span id="Sx10.T8.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Model Name</span></td>
